      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I have a clear picture of the original test. Key improvements I'll make:\n1. Remove all unused imports and dead code (`BOUND`, `assertArrayEqualsAt`)\n2. Replace the manual loop with `@ParameterizedTest` + `@ValueSource` (the imports were already there but unused)\n3. Use a single `Base58` instance per test case (encode + decode on same instance)\n4. Clearer variable namingThe improved test compiles successfully. The refactored version replaces the manual `for` loop with `@ParameterizedTest` + `@ValueSource`, removes all unused imports and dead code (`BOUND`, `assertArrayEqualsAt`), and uses a single `Base58` instance per test case — making each input a separately named, independently runnable test."
